{"id":"en_a-birthmark-exposed-my-husband-s-secret","title":"A Birthmark Exposed My Husband’s Secret","titleEn":"A Birthmark Exposed My Husband’s Secret","description":"Vivienne and Adrian are on the verge of adopting a young girl when Vivienne spots a small birthmark, about the size of a pea, on the child's hand. She refuses to complete the adoption on the spot and asks for a divorce. Adrian drops to his knees in pleading, while his relatives brand her as cold, childless by choice, and unfeeling. The little girl herself asks Vivienne to stay. To everyone around her, ending a happy marriage over something so minor seems inexplicable, and Vivienne offers no justification. Only when she presents three reports at a public press conference does the reality connected to that birthmark start to come to light.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-birthmark-exposed-my-husbands-secret/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/a-birthmark-exposed-my-husbands-secret/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Divorce","Infidelity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpa2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_a-birthmark-exposed-my-husband-s-secret_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpa2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-birthmark-exposed-my-husband-s-secret_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpa2/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_a-birthmark-exposed-my-husband-s-secret_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvpa2/?pub=